# IsoRim animals batch birds1 (blob style, bound 2026-11-16, branch animals6): Duck drake + hen, Goose, Ostrich, Emu, Cassowary;
# duck and goose wings (Api 14 wingModel, drawn only in flight: Api 80 wingsInFlightOnly), ratite legs (legModel).
# From model-review\birds1\out_v4 (tools/make_birds1_concept.py); the leg materials renamed *_blob_leg (isorim.mtl has the old
# an_*_leg). Colours baked in the textures (vanilla sprite colours), Kd 0.96; the ostrich is white x the vanilla colour
# (tintFromGraphic), its neck, head, plumes and legs untinted by their own vertex colours.
